{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "duo_ke",
    "description": "Chen (2021) Eq 10 / C39 kinetic energy on the covariant curvilinear frame: K = (u^2 - 2 cosA u v + v^2) / (2 (1 - cosA^2)), the invariant K = 1/2(u u^1 + v u^2) for covariant components (u,v) raised by the metric g^{ij} = (1/sin^2 a) [[1,-cos a],[-cos a,1]] with sin^2 a = 1 - cos^2 a. Equals the paper's interface expression 1/2(u|| u~|| + u_perp u~_perp) and is independent of the gnomonic projection. cosA is the grid's duo_cos_alpha (the angle between the unit covariant basis vectors) at the evaluation point; on the diagonal-metric limit cosA -> 0 it collapses to 1/2(u^2+v^2). AXIS-NEUTRAL scalar algebra; the consumer binds (u,v) to the interface-reconstructed covariant components and cosA to the interface metric. K enters the momentum RHS as -grad K (Eqs 7-8).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:stencil",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:duo",
      "op:kinetic_energy",
      "order:2",
      "scheme:vector_invariant"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Chen, X. (2021). The LMARS based shallow-water dynamical core on generic gnomonic cubed sphere geometry. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 13(1), e2020MS002280.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2020MS002280"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_templates": {
    "duo_ke": {
      "params": [
        "u",
        "v",
        "cosA"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
          {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "u",
                  "u"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                  "v",
                  "v"
                ]
              },
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      {
                        "op": "*",
                        "args": [
                          {
                            "op": "*",
                            "args": [
                              2,
                              "cosA"
                            ]
                          },
                          "u"
                        ]
                      },
                      "v"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              2,
              {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                  1,
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      "cosA",
                      "cosA"
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
